      "id": "claim_c913dbf2990149f8b69ce692374c2995",
      "statement": "WebDecoy treats User-Agent matching as declared identity for cooperative-agent policy rather than proof of identity: agents can spoof a browser string, while behavior-oriented controls are intended for agents that lie about their User-Agent.",
